      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Tucson is bordered to the east by the city itself and to the west by the Tucson Mountains, which include part of Saguaro National Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
